    "text": "NO. 1 OF 2019\n\n[10th January, 2019.]\nAn Act further to amend the Right of Children to Free and Compulsory\n\nEducation Act, 2009.\n\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the Sixty-ninth Year of the Republic of India as follows:—",
